/* ------------------------------------------------------------- website
 * Not on the documented change list, but draft 2 found the PARSED VALUE changing for
 * " https://example.com ". These probes ask how far that goes: is zod 4 only trimming, or is it
 * normalising (default port, host case, dot segments, IDN -> punycode, empty path -> "/")? */
